Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},It had rained in Sol for\Nnine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.74,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},One man never got wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:08.10,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},They called him Aura\Nmonster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:10.93,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Midnight, no coat, no hat,\Nbone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The shopkeepers said luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The police said a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The kids said magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.65,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So one night I followed\Nhim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The rain stopped around\Nme.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:20.62,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then I saw why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He wasn't dodging the\Nstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:25.94,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He was holding it up, one\Nwalk at a time, so the\Ncity could sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He turned, tired, and\Nsmiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},“Your turn.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Now I walk these streets\Nat midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:33.02,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},And I never get wet.
